@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant "RegisterActivity" as UI
participant "JsonObject\n(Gson)" as JSON
participant "RestClient" as Net
database "RestDB (REST API)" as API

activate User
User -> UI : clicks Register button
activate UI

note right of UI: Validates non-empty\nname, email, and password

UI -> JSON ** : new JsonObject()
UI -> JSON : addProperty("name", name)
UI -> JSON : addProperty("email", email)
UI -> JSON : addProperty("password", password)
UI -> JSON : addProperty("active", true)

UI -> Net : makeRequest(url, "POST", json.toString(), apiKey, callback)
activate Net

note right of Net: Runs asynchronously via AsyncTask\nand HttpURLConnection (Off-UI-Thread)

Net -> API : POST /rest/users (JSON payload with headers)
activate API
API --> Net : 201 Created (new record JSON)
deactivate API

Net --> UI : onSuccess(result)
deactivate Net

note right of UI: Displays "Account created successfully!" (Toast)\nand finishes activity to return to Login

UI -> UI : finish()
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
